WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.950
I landed far to the north, on a plain full of rocks.

2
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:14.710
In winter I watched a thin layer of frost form around me — water ice on Mars!

3
00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:19.180
My batteries finally gave out in 1980.

4
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.370
I saw frost on Mars.
